# e2e/w81-replay.spec.ts — a real game for a replay to play back: combat with a
# death on each side, a stack of two, draws, three turns.
# bob (ai keys, seat 1) is attacking alice (human keys, seat 0) with Runeclaw
# Bear; `activephase` lands on Declare ATTACKERS Step, never Declare Blockers
# itself (README: "Combat, specifically"). alice blocks with Grizzly Bears and
# the two trade. In bob's second main phase he casts Memnite and, holding
# priority, Dark Ritual over it (`stackTwoSpells`). Then turns pass: alice draws
# a Mountain on turn 2, bob a Swamp on turn 3, and bob concedes.
# alice keeps Lightning Bolt in hand throughout, so both hands hold a card a
# replay must show face up.
turn=1
activeplayer=ai
activephase=COMBAT_DECLARE_ATTACKERS
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Lightning Bolt
humanbattlefield=Mountain;Grizzly Bears
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=Memnite;Dark Ritual
aibattlefield=Swamp;Runeclaw Bear|Attacking
ailibrary=Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
aigraveyard=
